<title>JAPAN: Canon says no plan to withdraw from chip business.</title>
<headline>Canon says no plan to withdraw from chip business.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canon Inc said on Tuesday that it has no plan to withdraw from the semiconductor equipment business.  </p>
<p>&quot;We have no plan to withdraw from the semiconductor equipment business,&quot; a Canon spokesman said.</p>
<p>He was responding to a question on whether Canon knew about a rumour in the Dutch stock market that Canon was planning to leave the semiconductor equipment business.</p>
<p>&quot;I don't know about the rumour,&quot; he added.</p>
</text>
